## Read this first

The durable project memory is now layered. Read in this order:

1. `checkpoints/README.md` — mandatory append-only checkpoint policy;
2. the **latest `CP-XXX_*.md`** in `checkpoints/` — latest chronological snapshot;
3. `RESEARCH_STATUS.md` — current scientific state;
